    "text": "For the circuit shown, with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> , <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> , <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the potential difference between the points <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8216;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8217;</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8216;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8217;</mi></math> is approximately ( <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> ):<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0277_a63a8fa8837a.jpg\" />"
